# Auto push & deploy

After any change to this static site (HTML/CSS/JS/assets/config), finish by deploying:

1. Commit the relevant files.
2. Push to `origin` `main` (`https://github.com/AAAA-web-deploy/GROKIUS.git`).
3. GitHub Pages redeploys via `.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml` on every push to `main`.

Prefer: `.\deploy.ps1` or an equivalent `git add` / `commit` / `push` sequence.

Do not ask whether to push when the user asked for a site update — push and confirm the live URL: https://aaaa-web-deploy.github.io/GROKIUS/

Use commit identity via `-c user.name=AAAA-web-deploy -c user.email=AAAA-web-deploy@users.noreply.github.com` if needed. Do not edit global git config.
